\ marks0.6502 - marks.6502's helpers, assembled for rows 0-2 (main.6502's row0 section).

\ mk_base: X = strip (gb set). d0 = its first marker's ground (gb + mph x 8); X = strip x 4,
\ its first `msv`.
.mk_base
    LDA mph,X
    ASL A : ASL A : ASL A       \ (C clear: mph x 8 <= 152)
    ADC gb
    STA d0
    LDA gb + 1
    ADC #0
    STA d0 + 1
    TXA
    ASL A : ASL A
    TAX
    RTS

\ mk_next: d0 to the next marker's ground, 20 columns on; X + 1. Z set after the fourth.
.mk_next
    CLC
    LDA d0
    ADC #MARK_GAP * 8
    STA d0
    BCC mn_same
    INC d0 + 1
.mn_same
    INX
    TXA
    AND #3
    RTS

\ A small routine, here for room in main RAM (the RAM hunt, 2026-11-15):
\ irq_timer_hook must be in place before install_irq (reloc copies rows 0-2; not the stack
\ page, which start copies after it: an interrupt in between hung a Master, 2026-11-15).
\ irq_timer_hook (main.6502's, irq.6502 calls it): a band the raster has left
.irq_timer_hook
    INC bands
    RTS
